ings PC enjoys a long history of successful personal injury claims in the Glendale area and throughout Arizona. Our reputation and resources help us to successfully draft compelling demand letters on behalf of our clients to insurance companies, often leading to substantial settlements without court litigation. However, our experienced personal injury lawyers are more than willing to advocate aggressively for your case in court if necessary to maximize your chance of gaining the full compensation you deserve for the injury you’ve suffered and its impact on your life."],"listItems":[],"paragraphsAfterList":[],"imageUrl":"http://hastingsandhastings.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-location-glendale-will-your-personal-injury-claim-end.jpg","imageId":10820,"imagePosition":"right","id":"mqvmpds7aof1v1ghc5"},{"heading":"What a Glendale Personal Injury Lawyer Can do For You","paragraphs":["After your free evaluation by an attorney on our team, your attorney will begin collecting and examining evidence in your case including:"],"listItems":["Police report, accident report, or incident report","Medical reports and bills","Any photo evidence of the accident scene and your injuries","Any existing video footage","Eyewitness testimony","Testimony of expert witnesses such as doctors and accident reconstruction specialists"],"paragraphsAfterList":["After collecting evidence to prove liability and clearly show the damages resulting from your injury, our team will strongly negotiate with insurance companies to help you gain the compensation you deserve through a substantial settlement or argue your case in court to maximize your chance of positive jury verdict and a court award for your economic and non-economic damages."],"imageUrl":"http://hastingsandhastings.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-location-glendale-what-your-PI-lawyer.jpg","imageId":10819,"imagePosition":"left","id":"mqvmpds7a1erm5xu7pj"}]} /-->

